  "body": "## What's new\n- **Sleep timer** (15 min – 2 h): fades out and pauses, works with the app closed\n- **Last station restored** when you reopen the app — one tap to continue\n- **Favorites | Recently played** switch\n- Catalog: sort by popularity or name, station counts per category, \"Clear filters\"\n- Redesigned player: LIVE / CONNECTING / PAUSED / ERROR badge, landscape layout; multi-column layout on tablets\n- Background status in Settings (Android restriction, battery optimization, Xiaomi Autostart) and a warning when Android blocks background playback\n- Better TalkBack accessibility\n\n## Download\n- **Dominix-v1.1.0.apk** — install directly (Android 7.0+)\n- **Dominix-v1.1.0.zip** — same APK in a ZIP, for browsers that hang on APK downloads (e.g. Brave on Xiaomi)\n\nInstalls over earlier versions — favorites and settings are kept.\n\n**Xiaomi / Redmi / POCO:** Settings → Apps → Dominix → Battery saver → *No restrictions*, and enable *Autostart* (also reachable from Dominix → Settings).\n\n© 2026 Dominantus. All rights reserved.\n\nSHA-256 (APK): `8963ad0ecef785d357b5c33becdae206133b11753987dbaa130677a1c98edacf`\n"
